  "title": "Entrada Therapeutics to Announce Topline Results from Cohort 1 of Participants with Duchenne Muscular Dystrophy Treated with ENTR-601-44 in Phase 1/2 ELEVATE-44-201 Study on May 7, 2026",
  "summary": "BOSTON, May 06, 2026 (GLOBE NEWSWIRE) -- Entrada Therapeutics, Inc. (Nasdaq: TRDA) will announce topline results from Cohort 1 of the double-blind, placebo-controlled, multiple ascending dose portion of the Phase 1/2 ELEVATE-44-201 clinical study of ENTR-601-44 on Thursday, May 7, 2026.",
